    <mxCell id="v3db_gone" value="&lt;b&gt;Gone in v3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;newsletter_issues: rows become content pieces with channel Substack; outline, letter and scratch become the piece's draft fields.&lt;br&gt;newsletter_links: renamed content_piece_items, so any piece can link Library items.&lt;br&gt;pipeline_pieces: renamed content_pieces; stage becomes status; publish becomes published fields; distribution goes (a cross-post is its own piece).&lt;br&gt;Interesting Ideas and Validated Ideas collections: become insights with status new and validated.&lt;br&gt;items.origin: mine becomes an insight, reading becomes a Source, analyse becomes a Reference, ai becomes a Source." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="40" y="1530" width="1500" height="113.6" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="rel_head" value="&lt;b&gt;How the tables link&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="40" y="1763.6" width="2800" height="31.4" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="rel_sub" value="One box per v3 table. Each arrow is a link field, drawn from the table that holds it to the table it points to. Dashed = the link can be empty. Laid out like the ontology: Find on the left, Learn on the right." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
